<section class="panel"><h2>Recruitment launch checks</h2><p>Recruitment remains closed until private configuration, legal/privacy review and delivery tests are complete. These controls do not configure your Resend key or sender domain.</p><ul><?php $issues=r_readiness($pdo);foreach($issues as $issue):?><li><?= e($issue) ?></li><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$issues):?><li>Global configuration checks passed. Individually published roles still require future deadlines.</li><?php endif;?></ul><p class="field-help">For attachments, also enable uploads and verify private storage. Test the non-sensitive storage access-check URL: it must return 403, without its contents. Applications involving anyone under 18 remain disabled.</p><form method="post" action="<?= e(admin_url('settings')) ?>"><?php csrf_input();?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="recruitment_toggle"><label for="recruitment_enabled">Global recruitment switch</label><select id="recruitment_enabled" name="recruitment_enabled"><option value="0">Disabled</option><option value="1"<?= setting($pdo,'recruitment_enabled','0')==='1'?' selected':'' ?>>Enabled, subject to configuration checks</option></select><label for="recruit_confirm">Your current private code</label><input id="recruit_confirm" name="confirm_code" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="72"><button class="button">Save recruitment switch</button></form>
<form method="post" action="<?= e(admin_url('settings')) ?>"><?php csrf_input();?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="recruitment_mail_test"><label for="test_email">Send a transactional email test to</label><input id="test_email" name="test_email" type="email" required maxlength="254"><label for="test_confirm">Your current private code</label><input id="test_confirm" name="confirm_code" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="72"><button class="button">Send Resend test</button></form><p class="field-help">An accepted API request does not guarantee inbox delivery. Confirm receipt before setting email.delivery_verified=true in private config. No verification codes or message bodies are stored in delivery logs.</p></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Recent email delivery tests</h2><?php $tests=$pdo->query("SELECT delivery_status,result_code,created_at FROM recruitment_delivery_log WHERE purpose='test' ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 10")->fetchAll();if(!$tests):?><p>No test deliveries have been attempted.</p><?php else:foreach($tests as $test):?><p><?= e($test['created_at'].' UTC · '.$test['delivery_status'].' · '.$test['result_code']) ?></p><?php endforeach;endif;?><p class="field-help">HTTP 0 indicates a connection or transport failure. Authentication/sender failures require checking the private Resend configuration. Confirm accepted messages in the recipient inbox.</p></section>
